"A water nymph of Level 18 lives in the tarn; she feeds on mana and would crave Nala's."
"The nymph takes the shape of whoever a victim most desires, and her charm holds them still."
"Under the tarn lies a water mana node, a deep well of mana that feeds the whole lake."
"Near the node Nala's Mana Weaver lends her workings twice what it does elsewhere."
"The nymph guards the node, and is no friend of the blight; she might be bargained with."
